{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PC Building Empire is an indie idle and cozy game focused on light management, currently in Early Access. The idea is, together with community feedback, to gradually expand the simulation and strategy aspects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the game, you manage a computer store that grows little by little:</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2022 <strong>Build PCs manually</strong> in an assembly minigame that teaches essential parts and their rarities.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3588630/extras/d883516490316e8a5822e66b5efb9689.poster.avif?t=1759114960\" width=508 height=286 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3588630/extras/d883516490316e8a5822e66b5efb9689.webm?t=1759114960\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3588630/extras/d883516490316e8a5822e66b5efb9689.mp4?t=1759114960\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2022 <strong>Manage employees</strong>, each with unique buffs and debuffs that can either speed up or hinder your progress.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3588630/extras/ac91bb060cc08648fdf4c8472ef4fc5b.poster.avif?t=1759114960\" width=508 height=286 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3588630/extras/ac91bb060cc08648fdf4c8472ef4fc5b.webm?t=1759114960\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3588630/extras/ac91bb060cc08648fdf4c8472ef4fc5b.mp4?t=1759114960\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2022 <strong>Create videos</strong> in content production rooms and watch your brand gain visibility.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3588630/extras/f78d3e5421c4aeaf94c3bd10ef4fe1a0.poster.avif?t=1759114960\" width=508 height=286 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3588630/extras/f78d3e5421c4aeaf94c3bd10ef4fe1a0.webm?t=1759114960\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3588630/extras/f78d3e5421c4aeaf94c3bd10ef4fe1a0.mp4?t=1759114960\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2022 <strong>Expand your company</strong> by purchasing new rooms and customizing floors, colors, and style.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3588630/extras/5beb95bff2738942800d0b4c6a24648b.poster.avif?t=1759114960\" width=508 height=286 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3588630/extras/5beb95bff2738942800d0b4c6a24648b.webm?t=1759114960\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3588630/extras/5beb95bff2738942800d0b4c6a24648b.mp4?t=1759114960\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2022 <strong>Manage hiring</strong> at the central computer, posting job openings and choosing who will be part of your team.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poste